# GoMeta public repository — generated-file exclusions.
# Manifest.toml receipts are machine-resolved (Pkg.instantiate / Pkg.resolve in place); none
# is tracked — a fresh clone resolves its own environments from the Project.toml contracts.
/Manifest.toml
/tests/Manifest.toml
/test/Manifest.toml
# Documenter build artifacts: docs/make.jl stages docs/src/ from the committed docs/*.md
# pages at build time and renders into docs/build/; the docs environment resolves its own
# Manifest. All three are generated, never tracked.
/docs/src/
/docs/build/
/docs/Manifest.toml
